3. TRL GRPO configuration semantics
   The SA-GRPO algorithm is realised through five configuration values of TRL's
   GRPOConfig (num_generations, scale_rewards, beta, epsilon/epsilon_high, loss_type)
   plus this repository's reward functions. No GRPO trainer code is modified.

